    <Box style={{ width: 1120, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '14px 22px', boxSizing: 'border-box', marginTop: 22 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>XGBoost R&sup2;: <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.75</span> (random) &rarr; <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.68</span> (scaffold) &rarr; <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>&minus;0.79</span> (time). A model trained on pre-2019 chemistry cannot rank the FAPI series at all &mdash; enrichment EF10 = 0.96, i.e. no better than random picks.</Text>
