    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>RF &asymp; XGBoost &gt; SVR &gt; ridge on both interpolation protocols; ridge degrades least under time splitting because it relies on additive physicochemical trends rather than scaffold-specific fingerprints.</Text>
